---
// src/components/Modpack.astro
---
<section class="py-20 bg-theme-panel relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-green-500/5 pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center relative z-10">
        
        <span class="bg-green-500/10 text-green-500 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-widest border border-green-500/20 mb-4 inline-block">
            Experiencia Recomendada
        </span>
        
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-display font-bold text-theme-main mb-6">
            JUEGA CON <span class="text-green-500">MODRINTH</span>
        </h2>
        
        <p class="text-theme-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 text-lg">
            Aunque puedes entrar con un cliente Vanilla, te pierdes el 50% de la experiencia.
            <br>Nuestro modpack oficial incluye mejoras de rendimiento, shaders complementarios y texturas conectadas.
        </p>

        <a href="https://modrinth.com/modpack/builtechraft-mods" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold transition-all shadow-lg hover:shadow-green-500/30 transform hover:-translate-y-1">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-1 17.93c-3.95-.49-7-3.85-7-7.93 0-.62.08-1.21.21-1.79L9 15v1c0 1.1.9 2 2 2v1.93zm6.9-2.54c-.26-.81-1-1.39-1.9-1.39h-1v-3c0-.55-.45-1-1-1H8v-2h2c.55 0 1-.45 1-1V7h2c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2v-.41c2.93 1.19 5 4.06 5 7.41 0 2.08-.8 3.97-2.1 5.39z"/></svg>
            Instalar Modpack Oficial
        </a>

    </div>
</section>